sub('First proof by the author; an independent agent checked the statistical conditional and generic reconstruction bounds, not the complete architecture, finite spline construction or literature.', 'First proof by the author; two distinct independent reviews cover the stated conditional statistical/generic inversion claims and the declared structured-mask architecture, finite splines and accounting. They are bounded mathematical diagnostics, not formal verification, full literature clearance or acceptance.')
