sub('Two attention blocks have the following allowed explicit causal structural masks.', 'Two attention blocks have the following allowed explicit causal structural masks. With d_k=4, take matching-head W_Q=2 log(2) P_query and W_K=P_key, so the scaled score equals log(2) times the one-hot inner product. Its W_V selects the successor bit. The uniform head takes W_Q=W_K=0 and W_V selecting the successor bit and all four one-hot historical key coordinates. The two singleton-copy heads take W_Q=W_K=0, W_V selecting the raw bit, and separate output projections to the two lag coordinates.')
